claim.claim-text:
- a sealed lamp envelope (11); and
- a light source mount assembly (10) with one or more LED units (12) arranged inside the sealed lamp envelope (11);
wherein the sealed lamp envelope (11) is of essentially cylindrical shape, and wherein the distance between a distal end (21) and/or proximal end (22) of the sealed lamp envelope (11) and the LED unit (12) nearest to said end (21, 22) of the sealed lamp envelope (11) is smaller than four times, preferably three times, more preferably twice the diameter (d) of the sealed lamp envelope (11).
